22-**Agent Deck is mission control for your AI coding agents.** Running Claude Code on ten projects, OpenCode on five more, another agent somewhere in the background? One terminal shows every session — running, waiting, or done — and one keystroke switches between them. Groups, search, forking, git worktrees, cost tracking, and a phone-controlled [conductor](#conductor) keep a whole fleet manageable.
