120-## Quickstart: orchestrate a fleet of AI agents
121-
122-Five minutes from zero to a Telegram bot that watches every Claude session you have running.
123-
124-```bash
125-# 1. Create a Telegram bot via @BotFather, grab the token + your user ID from @userinfobot.
126-# 2. Run the wizard — it sets up the conductor, bridge daemon, and heartbeat in one shot.
127-agent-deck conductor setup work --description "Work fleet"
128-agent-deck session start conductor-work
129-# 3. Message your bot:  /status
130-```
131-
132-That's it. From now on every other agent-deck session you run is supervised by a single
133-"conductor" session that answers routine questions, escalates the interesting ones to your
134-phone, and never lets a `waiting` worker rot.
