139-  state files, lifecycle, remote channel setup (Telegram/Slack/Discord), gotchas.
140-- [**`docs/WATCHER-SETUP.md`**](docs/WATCHER-SETUP.md) — add "doorbells" so the outside world
141-  (GitHub events, gmail, ntfy pushes, meetings) can wake the conductor up.
